  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">• Brand introduction:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"175\" id=\"isPasted\">Thinkers</strong> is a parent-led brand on a mission to uncover and address the&nbsp;<em data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"251\">root causes</em> behind speech delays, emotional dysregulation, and cognitive challenges in children.<br data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"339\">We help families take action early — before it’s “too late” — using science-backed solutions and toxin-free products that support brain development from every angle.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">• Product description:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><strong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"560\">BabyBright</strong> is a gentle detox supplement designed to help children eliminate hidden toxins — like heavy metals — that may silently block brain function and speech development.<br data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"727\">It’s formulated with Zeolite, Vitamin B2, and other natural binders that support focus, calm, and verbal expression.<br data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"846\">Best for ages 18 months and up.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• USP (Unique Selling Point):</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">We don’t just treat symptoms — we help parents remove&nbsp;<em data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1013\" id=\"isPasted\">what’s holding their child back</em>.<br data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1017\">→ Root cause focused.<br data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1041\">→ Built for sensitive kids.<br data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1071\">→ Trusted by thousands of early-intervention families.<br data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1128\">→ 100% natural and easy to use daily.<br data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1168\">→ Paired with full-environment protection (bath filters, clean home kits, etc.)</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• Payment terms:</p><ul><li data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"317\" id=\"isPasted\"><p data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"317\">Affiliates are paid either via <strong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"243\">PayPal</strong>, <strong data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"262\">bank transfer</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"283\">store credit</strong>, depending on their preference.</p></li><li data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"428\"><p data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"428\">Payments are made on a <strong data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"359\">net-14 basis</strong> (14 days after sale confirmation), allowing for any refund window.</p></li><li data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"466\"><p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"466\">Minimum payout threshold: <strong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"464\">$50</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"561\"><p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"561\">Store credit payouts are processed instantly and can be used toward any product on our site.</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• Other information:</p><ul data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1829\" id=\"isPasted\"><li data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1605\"><p data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1605\">Ships internationally (USA 3–5 days / Europe 5–9 days).</p></li><li data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1643\"><p data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1643\">Lab-tested for safety and purity.</p></li><li data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1712\"><p data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1712\">Used by parents, educators, and therapists in over 30 countries.</p></li><li data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1773\"><p data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1773\">Private Facebook support group available after purchase.</p></li><li data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1829\"><p data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1829\">Designed for early support — even before a diagnosis.</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br></p></div></div>",
